`ind-a r R F3.10 B` MEANS `ind-a r R` `from the day the Commissioner receives or makes each copy` `the calendar year` `a registered charity is an entity entered in the general or the restricted section only` `the day of the event is not counted, so the last day of the period is the anniversary` `the date moves back to the last day of the month` `on the day of the entry` `the latest year that has ended before the day asked` `every notice that has been served` `an entity that its constitutional Law requires to have a registered office or business address in Jersey` `Article 8(4)(b) applies and gives no address` `the section the entity was entered in immediately before deregistration` `whoever makes the request, an applicant for registration or a registered charity` `Article 8(3)(a) reaches only the sub-paragraphs it names`
`ind-a r R F3.12 B` MEANS `ind-a r R` `from the day the Commissioner receives or makes each copy` `the calendar year` `a registered charity is an entity entered in the general or the restricted section only` `the day of the event is not counted, so the last day of the period is the anniversary` `the date moves back to the last day of the month` `on the day of the entry` `the latest year that has ended before the day asked` `every notice that has been served` `an entity that its constitutional Law requires to have a registered office or business address in Jersey` `Article 8(4)(b) does not apply, so Article 8(4)(c) is reached` `the section the entity was entered in immediately before deregistration` `only an applicant for registration` `Article 8(3)(a) reaches only the sub-paragraphs it names`
`ind-a r R F3.13 B` MEANS `ind-a r R` `from the day the Commissioner receives or makes each copy` `the calendar year` `a registered charity is an entity entered in the general or the restricted section only` `the day of the event is not counted, so the last day of the period is the anniversary` `the date moves back to the last day of the month` `on the day of the entry` `the latest year that has ended before the day asked` `every notice that has been served` `an entity that its constitutional Law requires to have a registered office or business address in Jersey` `Article 8(4)(b) does not apply, so Article 8(4)(c) is reached` `the section the entity was entered in immediately before deregistration` `whoever makes the request, an applicant for registration or a registered charity` `Article 8(3)(a) treats sub-paragraph (ba) like sub-paragraphs (f) to (j) for the note of sub-paragraph (a) and like (e), (g), (h) and (j) for the details`

